<title>PERU: Peru's bank liquidity rises 3.3 pct in Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Peru's bank liquidity rises 3.3 pct in Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's total banking system liquidity rose 3.3 percent in the first quarter to 32.532 billion soles, the Central Reserve Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Liquidity at the end of 1996 was 31.498 billion soles.</p>
<p>((-- Marcel Deza, Lima newsroom 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
